WEBVTT

00:00:58.042 --> 00:01:00.792
[muffled breathing]

00:01:23.292 --> 00:01:24.292
[beeps]

00:01:56.750 --> 00:01:57.707
[beeps]

00:01:57.708 --> 00:02:00.375
[all beeping]

00:02:12.917 --> 00:02:15.707
[♪ adventurous music playing]

00:02:15.708 --> 00:02:18.417
[birds squawking]

00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:23.958
[wailing sound plays]

00:02:52.792 --> 00:02:55.083
[♪ enchanting music playing]

00:03:00.792 --> 00:03:02.375
Star.

00:03:05.917 --> 00:03:07.583
Comm... Command.

00:03:11.125 --> 00:03:12.333
Star.

00:03:12.917 --> 00:03:14.207
Command.

00:03:14.208 --> 00:03:17.374
[all] Star. Command.

00:03:17.375 --> 00:03:18.749
- Rendezvous!
- With!

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:19.957
[all] Star Command.

00:03:19.958 --> 00:03:38.333
Rendezvous with Star Command.

00:03:52.375 --> 00:03:57.417
a long time ago

00:04:00.042 --> 00:04:01.167
There.

00:04:03.250 --> 00:04:06.208
This way, you'll never lose me, Jessie.

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:10.166
<i>Friends forever, partner.</i>

00:04:10.167 --> 00:04:11.374
[giggles]

00:04:11.375 --> 00:04:13.124
That's right, partner.

00:04:13.125 --> 00:04:16.457
But don't you worry.
I'll keep a good eye on you.

00:04:16.458 --> 00:04:17.625
[grunts]

00:04:19.541 --> 00:04:22.374
See? I'm still watching.

00:04:22.375 --> 00:04:23.666
[giggles]

00:04:23.667 --> 00:04:26.666
I'm gone... [gasps] ...but I'm back.

00:04:26.667 --> 00:04:29.708
I'm gone. [gasps] I'm back.

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:32.207
I still see you.

00:04:32.208 --> 00:04:35.083
[gasps] Oh, no. [echoing] I'm gone.

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:37.499
now

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:40.624
And I will love you all the time...

00:04:40.625 --> 00:04:43.874
even when I'm mad or sad

00:04:43.875 --> 00:04:46.041
or leave you outside by accident.

00:04:46.042 --> 00:04:48.167
I'll still love you forever.

00:04:48.917 --> 00:04:50.416
[as Jessie] Really? You mean it?

00:04:50.417 --> 00:04:52.124
Forever and ever and ever?

00:04:52.125 --> 00:04:54.624
Yep. All the evers.

00:04:54.625 --> 00:04:57.707
Then do you, Forky, take Karen Beverly

00:04:57.708 --> 00:05:00.041
to be your beloved bride?

00:05:00.042 --> 00:05:01.416
[as Forky] I do.

00:05:01.417 --> 00:05:03.249
And do you, Karen Beverly?

00:05:03.250 --> 00:05:04.416
[as Karen Beverly] I do.

00:05:04.417 --> 00:05:06.542
[sobs, blows nose]

00:05:07.667 --> 00:05:09.082
[giggles]

00:05:09.083 --> 00:05:11.124
Yeehaw!

00:05:11.125 --> 00:05:13.624
I now pronounce you husband...

00:05:13.625 --> 00:05:15.750
and knife.

00:05:16.375 --> 00:05:18.166
[kissing]

00:05:18.167 --> 00:05:19.791
Kissy, kissy.

00:05:19.792 --> 00:05:22.166
- [kissing continues]
- [gasps]

00:05:22.167 --> 00:05:23.625
[chuckles]

00:05:25.458 --> 00:05:28.124
[gasps] Who poisoned the maid of honor?

00:05:28.125 --> 00:05:29.374
[shouts, groans]

00:05:29.375 --> 00:05:31.249
- [shouts]
- [all gasp]

00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:32.707
- [gasps]
- [screaming]

00:05:32.708 --> 00:05:38.166
Oh! Why? Why?

00:05:38.167 --> 00:05:39.458
Everyone!

00:05:40.083 --> 00:05:42.791
Step aside. I know CPR.

00:05:42.792 --> 00:05:44.625
One, two, three.

00:05:45.125 --> 00:05:48.249
Now, the kiss of life.

00:05:48.250 --> 00:05:49.332
[gasps]

00:05:49.333 --> 00:05:51.375
[inhales deeply, blows]

00:05:55.958 --> 00:05:56.957
Oh.

00:05:56.958 --> 00:05:58.707
[inhales deeply, blows]

00:05:58.708 --> 00:06:01.625
- [inhales deeply]
- [car approaching]

00:06:03.583 --> 00:06:04.624
[child 1 chuckling]

00:06:04.625 --> 00:06:06.667
[child 2] You're so funny.

00:06:09.917 --> 00:06:11.874
But we didn't solve my murder.

00:06:11.875 --> 00:06:14.166
Just hold your horses, Rex.

00:06:14.167 --> 00:06:15.957
Psst. Dolly, what's going on?

00:06:15.958 --> 00:06:17.749
[sighs] Not sure.

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:19.124
You know, at first I was mad

00:06:19.125 --> 00:06:20.416
Bonnie drew these glasses on me,

00:06:20.417 --> 00:06:22.332
but honestly, I can see
so much better now.

00:06:22.333 --> 00:06:23.916
Dolly, focus.

00:06:23.917 --> 00:06:24.999
Oh! Sorry.

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:27.207
It's the Jordan twins. They're back home.

00:06:27.208 --> 00:06:30.499
[twins chattering]

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:32.917
[laughing]

00:06:33.833 --> 00:06:37.000
Poor thing. She's still afraid
to ask them to play.

00:06:37.792 --> 00:06:39.500
Not this time. [grunts]

00:06:41.583 --> 00:06:42.624
[chattering continues]

00:06:42.625 --> 00:06:43.708
[Jessie grunts]

00:06:44.458 --> 00:06:46.791
<i>Giddy-up there! Time's a-wastin'!</i>

00:06:46.792 --> 00:06:48.125
[gasps] Oh, no.

00:06:54.167 --> 00:06:55.292
[twins laughing]

00:06:58.083 --> 00:06:59.749
That's it, Bonnie.

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:01.083
You can do it.

